      "sourceName": "Douglas County, NV",
      "title": "RFP Library 5-year Strategic Plan",
      "agency": "Douglas County, NV",
      "description": "RFP- Douglas County Public Library, A New Five-Year Strategic Plan 2028 to 2033\n\nPosted- 11/2/2026\n\nBids due- 11/20/2026\n\nLooking for a company or organization to help with the planning process of a new library strategic plan for the Douglas County Public Library.\n\nDescription: Planning process\n\nEarly 2027- help with the development process of a new strategic plan including the following starting in January 2027\n\n1. Internal and External Stakeholder- small group interviews\n\n2. Community survey- digital and paper. Use of the 2022 Survey as a “Base Comparison” with new questions as needed. Data input of surveys and summary analysis of the information.\n\n3. Collection and analysis of various socio-demographic, economic, and housing characteristics,\n\n4. Up to three strategic planning workshops (if needed) conduction of workshops with summary and analysis\n\na. Workshop 1- community and organizational assessment with the development of draft key elements (core values, mission/vision, goals, etc.)\n\nb. Workshop 2 & Workshop 3 (if needed) Refinement and development of the final key elements\n\n5. Development/Completion of a technical report\n\n6. Create a 2028 plan for implementation\n\nFour separate annual evaluations and updates:\n\n2029, 2030, 2031, 2032\n\nDevelopment/completion of four technical reports (summaries)\n\nProposal based on services provided\n\nContact information\n\nTimothy DeGhelder- Library Director\n\nQuestions and proposals can be emailed to the following address Timothy.deghelder@douglas.lib.nv.us\n\nThe current strategic plan can be viewed at the current webpage: https://shorturl.at/60Fiz\n\nReview and Download the Full RFP Here",
